Date: Thu, 8 Oct 2026 18:36:42 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Neko LineageOS: [FAS] Add AIDL infra allow fasd to apply
 recommended policy from fasd

Change-Id: I3d3c776837ca87b9095878ebd54384141f55cd61
---
 .../compatibility_matrix.system.xml           |  9 ++++++
 fas/aidl/Android.bp                           | 31 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../aidl_api/vendor.performance.fas/1/.hash   |  1 +
 .../vendor/performance/fas/CpuPolicyVote.aidl | 30 ++++++++++++++++++
 .../1/vendor/performance/fas/IFasBackend.aidl | 29 +++++++++++++++++
